WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.090
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:46.360 --> 01:47.000
Uncle.

3
01:48.160 --> 01:50.289
Are you still thinking about Feng Xue?

4
01:50.840 --> 01:51.520
Yes.

5
01:51.800 --> 01:52.520
I want to help her,

6
01:52.520 --> 01:54.160
but I can't think of a way.

7
01:55.800 --> 01:56.530
Don't worry.

8
01:56.840 --> 01:59.360
Sister Long will definitely take care of this.

9
01:59.360 --> 02:00.090
Stop wiping.

10
02:00.360 --> 02:01.440
Go back to sleep.

11
02:01.440 --> 02:02.720
Save your brainpower.

12
02:02.720 --> 02:04.360
You still have to prepare for the exam.

13
02:04.360 --> 02:04.960
Okay.

14
02:05.680 --> 02:06.480
Go to sleep.

15
02:06.600 --> 02:07.930
Stop thinking about it.

16
02:14.440 --> 02:15.160
Huzi.

17
02:15.640 --> 02:16.640
Help me move this.

18
02:17.240 --> 02:17.960
Where to?

19
02:18.560 --> 02:19.620
What's wrong, Mom?

20
02:19.800 --> 02:20.660
What happened?

21
02:21.040 --> 02:22.370
My back. What happened?

22
02:22.800 --> 02:23.760
You sprained your back.

23
02:23.760 --> 02:24.640
Let's go to the hospital.

24
02:24.640 --> 02:25.280
I'll go get the car.

25
02:25.280 --> 02:26.680
I'll back the car up.

26
02:28.560 --> 02:29.560
Slow down.

27
02:29.680 --> 02:30.480
Don't move.

28
02:30.480 --> 02:31.810
If it hurts, don't move.

29
02:32.720 --> 02:34.400
Your lumbar disc herniation

30
02:34.400 --> 02:35.400
is quite serious.

31
02:35.400 --> 02:37.260
Why did you wait until now to come?

32
02:37.920 --> 02:39.079
We run a bathhouse.

33
02:39.079 --> 02:40.640
We can't leave it unattended.

34
02:40.640 --> 02:41.520
Let me tell you.

35
02:41.520 --> 02:44.240
Your back can't stay in a damp place all the time.

36
02:44.640 --> 02:48.320
If you don't want it to get worse, you'd better change your environment.

37
02:48.320 --> 02:49.160
Understood, doctor.

38
02:49.160 --> 02:50.960
Just do whatever needs to be done.

39
02:50.960 --> 02:51.720
Prescribe medicine if needed.

40
02:51.720 --> 02:52.780
Operate if needed.

41
02:54.120 --> 02:55.120
What operation?

42
02:55.480 --> 02:56.720
Just prescribe some medicine.

43
02:56.720 --> 02:58.880
I'll be fine after applying patches and sleeping for a couple of days.

44
02:58.880 --> 03:00.000
Then I'll prescribe some medicine first,

45
03:00.000 --> 03:02.660
and you can do some physical therapy for a while.

46
03:04.040 --> 03:06.680
Will health insurance cover the physical therapy?

47
03:06.680 --> 03:08.440
You have to get treated whether it's covered or not.

48
03:08.440 --> 03:09.970
What are you talking about?

49
03:10.080 --> 03:10.720
Just leave it alone.

50
03:10.720 --> 03:11.720
Doctor, don't listen to her.

51
03:11.720 --> 03:13.360
Just do whatever needs to be done.

52
03:13.360 --> 03:13.840
Sorry for the trouble.

53
03:13.840 --> 03:14.440
Okay.

54
03:14.800 --> 03:15.440
Please wait a moment.

55
03:15.440 --> 03:16.120
Okay.

56
03:16.280 --> 03:16.880
Thank you.

57
03:18.760 --> 03:20.400
It's not a big deal.

58
03:20.520 --> 03:22.600
I'll be fine after applying patches for a couple of days.

59
03:22.600 --> 03:24.730
If health insurance doesn't cover it,

60
03:25.160 --> 03:26.620
it'll be quite expensive.

61
03:31.920 --> 03:33.880
So expensive.

62
03:34.320 --> 03:36.880
Why does it cost 580,000?

63
03:48.560 --> 03:49.960
It shouldn't be.

64
03:49.960 --> 03:53.000
Logically, I should be quite lucky.

65
03:53.560 --> 03:54.840
There's no problem.

66
04:10.440 --> 04:12.320
Daquan, did you see the message in the group?

67
04:12.320 --> 04:14.920
The group leader said Wangang's stock will definitely go up.

68
04:14.920 --> 04:15.780
Is it reliable?

69
04:19.279 --> 04:20.240
It's reliable.

70
04:20.240 --> 04:22.680
The group leader said there's inside information, so it's absolutely accurate.

71
04:22.680 --> 04:24.940
Brother Hu, hurry up and buy it tomorrow.

72
04:32.680 --> 04:34.000
After finishing the evaluation,

73
04:34.000 --> 04:36.880
Lawyer Li said your project has huge legal risks.

74
04:36.960 --> 04:38.020
Let's just drop it.

75
04:38.040 --> 04:39.200
If this project doesn't work out,

76
04:39.200 --> 04:40.800
there's always the next one.

77
04:41.400 --> 04:42.480
Li Xin, right?

78
04:42.560 --> 04:43.760
Don't cause trouble.

79
04:44.280 --> 04:46.080
You haven't been in the group for long.

80
04:46.080 --> 04:47.800
You haven't found your footing yet.

81
04:47.800 --> 04:49.120
Market experience is not something

82
04:49.120 --> 04:51.400
you can learn in a short time.

83
04:53.000 --> 04:53.860
How about this?

84
04:55.080 --> 04:56.940
I'll find something for you to do.

85
04:57.240 --> 05:00.480
The marketing department recently acquired a bathhouse.

86
05:00.480 --> 05:02.140
I'll leave it to you to manage.

87
05:02.560 --> 05:04.020
Use it for practice first.

88
05:05.000 --> 05:07.460
If you do well, we'll consider the next step.

89
05:22.520 --> 05:23.800
Hello, Mr. Wan.

90
05:25.760 --> 05:27.240
Come, say hello to Brother Hu.

91
05:27.240 --> 05:28.400
Hello, Brother Hu.

92
05:30.320 --> 05:31.960
What is this place?

93
05:32.840 --> 05:34.600
Is this a shop?

94
05:36.440 --> 05:37.200
This is too big.

95
05:37.200 --> 05:38.520
It feels so empty.

96
05:41.159 --> 05:42.360
There's even an echo.

97
05:42.400 --> 05:43.130
Shout again.

98
05:47.800 --> 05:49.159
It's too big.

99
05:50.000 --> 05:50.520
How is it?

100
05:50.520 --> 05:51.800
Is the law firm busy lately?

101
05:51.800 --> 05:54.040
It's okay. I'm planning to expand a bit,

102
05:54.159 --> 05:55.890
and develop some new business.

103
05:55.920 --> 05:57.850
How much can you make a month there?

104
05:58.520 --> 06:00.120
About eight to ten thousand.

105
06:01.640 --> 06:02.320
Really?

106
06:03.720 --> 06:04.760
Sometimes.

107
06:06.720 --> 06:07.650
Come work for me.

108
06:08.720 --> 06:09.400
What would I do here?

109
06:09.400 --> 06:11.240
Mix drinks?

110
06:11.240 --> 06:12.840
What do you mean, mix drinks?

111
06:12.880 --> 06:14.680
This place will be yours.

112
06:14.840 --> 06:16.840
You'll manage the whole bathhouse.

113
06:17.360 --> 06:19.200
Doesn't your family run a bathhouse?

114
06:19.200 --> 06:20.960
You have experience. No problem.

115
06:20.960 --> 06:22.640
My family's is called a public bath.

116
06:22.640 --> 06:25.280
Besides, the law firm can't do without me right now.

117
06:25.280 --> 06:27.340
What? Is the law firm partner a woman?

118
06:30.000 --> 06:31.530
Are you trying to hit on her?

119
06:31.840 --> 06:32.600
Look at you.

120
06:32.600 --> 06:35.040
Your thoughts are so dirty.

121
06:35.200 --> 06:36.640
We are totally incompatible.

122
06:36.640 --> 06:37.680
Come work for me.

123
06:37.800 --> 06:39.560
I'll give you 500,000 a year,

124
06:39.560 --> 06:41.600
with a 10% increase every year after.

125
06:41.600 --> 06:42.920
You can also get an advance.

126
06:42.920 --> 06:43.650
How about it?

127
06:44.560 --> 06:45.480
500,000?

128
06:46.080 --> 06:47.360
Stop kidding around.

129
06:47.360 --> 06:48.640
With such a big business,

130
06:48.640 --> 06:50.360
aren't you going to watch it yourself?

131
06:50.360 --> 06:52.290
I have more important things to do.

132
06:53.080 --> 06:53.960
So,

133
06:54.040 --> 06:56.360
I need to find someone I trust to keep an eye on it for me.

134
06:56.360 --> 06:58.440
Then you trust me a bit too much.

135
06:58.600 --> 06:59.440
Do you remember?

136
06:59.440 --> 07:01.080
Back when I dropped out of technical school,

137
07:01.080 --> 07:03.040
I was cornered in a dead end by a bunch of jerks,

138
07:03.040 --> 07:04.440
and beaten half to death.

139
07:04.600 --> 07:06.280
You were such a timid guy,

140
07:07.120 --> 07:09.050
but you risked your life to save me.

141
07:09.640 --> 07:10.570
All by yourself.

142
07:11.160 --> 07:12.960
If I don't trust you, who would I trust?

143
07:12.960 --> 07:15.200
The main thing was that if I didn't take that path,

144
07:15.200 --> 07:16.080
I couldn't go home.

145
07:16.080 --> 07:17.600
What? Are you embarrassed

146
07:17.640 --> 07:18.680
that you were nice to me?

147
07:18.680 --> 07:19.400
Okay.

148
07:19.480 --> 07:20.280
As long as you keep it in your heart.

149
07:20.280 --> 07:20.960
Come on, it's all in the drink.

150
07:20.960 --> 07:21.640
No.

151
07:21.640 --> 07:23.360
Do you think I can enjoy this all by myself?

152
07:23.360 --> 07:24.760
I have to bring you along.

153
07:26.880 --> 07:27.680
What's wrong?

154
07:28.720 --> 07:29.780
This is too strong.

155
07:30.520 --> 07:32.000
What kind of liquor is this?

156
07:32.000 --> 07:33.200
Still the same.

157
07:54.240 --> 07:55.640
Daquan, this...

158
07:55.640 --> 07:57.000
Why did all these stocks hit the limit down?

159
07:57.000 --> 07:58.480
I can't even sell them.

160
08:03.240 --> 08:04.000
I don't know.

161
08:04.000 --> 08:04.930
I'm trapped too.

162
08:05.120 --> 08:06.050
What's going on?

163
08:09.040 --> 08:09.960
Did you all see it?

164
08:09.960 --> 08:11.440
The official website has debunked the rumor.

165
08:11.440 --> 08:12.840
The news about entering the new energy sector

166
08:12.840 --> 08:14.520
was purely fake.

167
08:14.680 --> 08:16.240
The person who spread it is a total scammer.

168
08:16.240 --> 08:16.960
Brother Hu,

169
08:17.200 --> 08:17.720
later,

170
08:17.720 --> 08:19.240
you really have to be our representative

171
08:19.240 --> 08:20.840
and talk it out with the lawyer.

172
08:20.840 --> 08:22.080
I know you don't want

173
08:22.080 --> 08:23.960
the people at your law firm to know about this.

174
08:23.960 --> 08:24.520
So,

175
08:24.520 --> 08:26.280
we found another law firm.

176
08:26.280 --> 08:29.080
Among all the guys in this car, you know the law best.

177
08:29.080 --> 08:30.400
You really have to help us.

178
08:30.400 --> 08:31.840
Yeah, please.

179
08:31.840 --> 08:32.600
Okay, okay. I'll...

180
08:32.600 --> 08:34.240
I... I'll do my best, alright?

181
08:34.240 --> 08:36.100
Thank you, Brother Hu. Thank you.

182
08:38.320 --> 08:39.919
We're here. This is it.

183
08:40.400 --> 08:42.130
The biggest law firm in Leyang.

184
08:43.480 --> 08:45.400
This is Honghu.

185
08:49.040 --> 08:50.080
Just wait.

186
08:50.400 --> 08:52.880
Brother Hu is already here.

187
08:54.920 --> 08:56.120
What's the rush?

188
08:57.000 --> 08:58.360
The lawyer will be here soon.

189
08:58.360 --> 09:00.920
We'll ask him what's going on when he arrives.

190
09:03.480 --> 09:05.080
Ms. Guo, long time no see.

191
09:05.080 --> 09:06.600
Come, this way please.

192
09:07.120 --> 09:08.850
Brother Hu, what are you doing?

193
09:11.880 --> 09:12.600
Lawyer Li.

194
09:13.520 --> 09:14.980
Lawyer Li is finally here.

195
09:15.480 --> 09:17.400
We've been waiting for you, Mr. Li.

196
09:17.400 --> 09:18.920
We are here for a consultation.

197
09:18.920 --> 09:20.920
May I ask who is the representative?

198
09:21.040 --> 09:22.640
The representative? It's Brother Hu.

199
09:22.640 --> 09:23.800
Brother Hu. Hu.

200
09:24.640 --> 09:25.440
Brother Hu.

201
09:25.640 --> 09:26.080
Yes.

202
09:26.080 --> 09:27.040
We sent a representative.

203
09:27.040 --> 09:28.040
We were afraid we couldn't explain it clearly,

204
09:28.040 --> 09:29.640
so we let him talk to you. Brother Hu!

205
09:29.640 --> 09:30.360
Right.

206
09:30.360 --> 09:32.080
You have to stand up for us.

207
09:36.360 --> 09:37.220
He's crippled.

208
09:38.600 --> 09:39.960
Isn't this Beihu?

209
09:40.800 --> 09:42.200
How did he become a gecko?

210
09:45.080 --> 09:45.740
Let's talk.

211
09:50.200 --> 09:52.760
I thought your office would be trimmed with gold.

212
09:52.760 --> 09:54.160
It looks quite ordinary.

213
09:56.280 --> 09:57.000
Take a note.

214
09:57.600 --> 09:59.860
Tell me, how much did you invest in total?

215
10:00.200 --> 10:01.120
Over 500,000.

216
10:01.240 --> 10:02.040
Over 500,000?

217
10:03.280 --> 10:04.480
How much did you lose?

218
10:05.200 --> 10:06.160
I lost over 200,000.

219
10:06.160 --> 10:06.960
Over 200,000?

220
10:07.520 --> 10:09.640
Where did you get so much money? Did you take out a loan?

221
10:09.640 --> 10:11.500
Can you ask something important?

222
10:12.880 --> 10:13.880
How did you join the group?

223
10:13.880 --> 10:14.640
Someone added me.

224
10:14.640 --> 10:15.640
He got stuck too.

225
10:15.800 --> 10:17.400
What did the group admin say?

226
10:17.680 --> 10:19.480
He said he had insider information.

227
10:19.480 --> 10:20.360
He said Wangang...

228
10:20.360 --> 10:22.360
They are about to enter the new energy industry.

229
10:22.360 --> 10:23.880
And they even got a foreign patent.

230
10:23.880 --> 10:25.680
The stock will definitely go up.

231
10:27.280 --> 10:29.640
Did he say where he got this inside information?

232
10:29.640 --> 10:31.360
Who knows? No one asked.

233
10:31.360 --> 10:32.760
He just said he had inside information.

234
10:32.760 --> 10:33.640
And you just believed him?

235
10:33.640 --> 10:34.720
Well, he told me...

236
10:35.200 --> 10:37.000
Can you stop interrogating me?

237
10:37.280 --> 10:37.800
Just tell me,

238
10:37.800 --> 10:39.520
can I sue this guy or not?

239
10:40.920 --> 10:41.600
No.

240
10:42.800 --> 10:44.400
Insider trading is illegal to begin with.

241
10:44.400 --> 10:46.280
Then I can at least get my money back, right?

242
10:46.280 --> 10:47.200
Even less so.

243
10:47.240 --> 10:49.040
Illegal losses cannot be recovered.

244
10:49.040 --> 10:50.280
Then what have you been talking to me about all this time?

245
10:50.280 --> 10:51.240
Are you messing with me?

246
10:51.240 --> 10:52.680
You came to me for a consultation.

247
10:52.680 --> 10:54.200
Don't I have to understand the situation first?

248
10:54.200 --> 10:55.480
So your solution for me

249
10:55.480 --> 10:56.600
is that it can't be solved?

250
10:56.600 --> 10:59.330
That's why I won't charge you a consultation fee.

251
11:00.400 --> 11:01.600
Leave me your contact info.

252
11:01.600 --> 11:03.800
I'll ask you if anything comes up later.

253
11:04.440 --> 11:05.200
You can't solve it.

254
11:05.200 --> 11:06.800
Why do you want my contact info?

255
11:06.800 --> 11:07.960
Are you trying to hit on me?

256
11:07.960 --> 11:09.160
My contacts are full.

257
11:14.720 --> 11:17.280
Don't tell anyone about this.

258
11:18.000 --> 11:19.660
Is this how you ask for a favor?

259
11:20.360 --> 11:22.280
Fine, Li Xin, you win.

260
11:22.920 --> 11:24.200
I'm betting on your character.

261
11:24.200 --> 11:25.760
You're not one to gossip.

262
11:31.680 --> 11:32.280
Director.

263
11:33.640 --> 11:36.440
I suspect Wangang's information has been leaked.

264
11:37.760 --> 11:38.440
Mr. Wan.

265
11:44.600 --> 11:45.200
Li Xin.

266
11:46.400 --> 11:49.120
Are Honghu's confidentiality measures made of paper?

267
11:49.120 --> 11:51.720
Wangang's inside information is flying everywhere.

268
11:51.720 --> 11:53.560
The group's stock price has been affected.

269
11:53.560 --> 11:54.820
What do you have to say?

270
11:56.000 --> 11:57.000
Regarding the leak,

271
11:57.000 --> 11:58.720
we are already investigating.

272
11:58.720 --> 12:02.360
You just issued the evaluation report last week,

273
12:02.560 --> 12:04.920
and the stock price fluctuated the next day.

274
12:04.920 --> 12:06.240
How will you investigate?

275
12:06.240 --> 12:07.360
Investigate yourselves?

276
12:07.360 --> 12:08.280
But Mr. Wan,

277
12:08.480 --> 12:09.480
we are not

278
12:09.480 --> 12:11.120
the only ones who viewed the project materials.

279
12:11.120 --> 12:12.400
I've already checked.

280
12:12.840 --> 12:14.760
There are no issues with Wangang.

281
12:15.000 --> 12:17.000
Now I want you

282
12:17.360 --> 12:18.600
to list all Honghu personnel

283
12:18.600 --> 12:20.600
involved in the Wangang project

284
12:20.600 --> 12:21.640
for me.

285
12:21.880 --> 12:22.740
Did you hear me?

286
12:23.480 --> 12:24.000
Sure.

287
12:25.960 --> 12:26.820
Director Wang.

288
12:29.000 --> 12:32.360
Our company hires legal advisors at a high salary

289
12:32.480 --> 12:34.560
to avoid risks,

290
12:34.840 --> 12:36.880
not to plant landmines for ourselves.

291
12:36.880 --> 12:37.720
I hope

292
12:38.160 --> 12:40.960
you can give me a reasonable explanation.

293
12:41.560 --> 12:42.440
Rest assured.

294
12:42.760 --> 12:43.720
If it is confirmed

295
12:43.720 --> 12:46.120
that a lawyer from Honghu leaked the information,

296
12:46.120 --> 12:48.640
we will definitely deal with it seriously.

297
12:49.320 --> 12:51.050
That's what I call an attitude.

298
12:52.840 --> 12:54.320
I'll give you three days.

299
12:55.440 --> 12:56.920
If there are no results,

300
12:57.040 --> 12:59.800
we will terminate all cooperation with Honghu.

301
13:06.680 --> 13:09.610
Lao Tian, I've heated up the millet porridge for you.

302
13:09.800 --> 13:10.280
Okay.

303
13:15.080 --> 13:16.160
Leave it there. I'll eat it later.

304
13:16.160 --> 13:18.840
You've been staring at the computer since you got back.

305
13:18.840 --> 13:20.320
Your eyes are all red.

306
13:20.320 --> 13:21.520
You should eat first.

307
13:21.520 --> 13:22.560
Eating less

308
13:22.560 --> 13:24.360
will help lower my blood lipids.

309
13:26.000 --> 13:27.530
Then don't stay up too late.

310
14:01.760 --> 14:02.440
Look here.

311
14:03.160 --> 14:04.280
With a one-second difference,

312
14:04.280 --> 14:06.940
the sachet by the door is facing a different way.

313
14:08.120 --> 14:10.050
This video has indeed been edited.

314
14:10.160 --> 14:11.280
No wonder the part where Feng Xue said

315
14:11.280 --> 14:12.540
she ran out is missing.

316
14:13.440 --> 14:14.320
This sachet

317
14:14.320 --> 14:16.720
must have changed direction after the door

318
14:16.800 --> 14:18.320
was forcefully opened and closed.

319
14:18.320 --> 14:19.800
The video must have been tampered with by Wei Dong.

320
14:19.800 --> 14:20.660
I remember now.

321
14:20.840 --> 14:22.360
Feng Xue's colleague said that the next morning,

322
14:22.360 --> 14:23.680
she saw Wei Dong throwing away the trash.

323
14:23.680 --> 14:25.360
He must have edited the surveillance footage,

324
14:25.360 --> 14:27.120
replaced the old card with a new one,

325
14:27.120 --> 14:28.400
and then thrown the old card away.

326
14:28.400 --> 14:29.080
Luo Zhi,

327
14:29.520 --> 14:30.480
check

328
14:30.840 --> 14:32.120
which nearby dump the hair salon's trash

329
14:32.120 --> 14:34.400
is taken to.

330
14:34.800 --> 14:35.400
Okay.

331
14:36.560 --> 14:37.490
What do you mean?

332
14:38.400 --> 14:40.000
What, dig through the trash?

333
14:40.200 --> 14:40.960
It's been days.

334
14:40.960 --> 14:41.840
Where are we going to find it?

335
14:41.840 --> 14:43.520
We have to look for it anyway.

336
14:43.520 --> 14:44.080
Yeah.

337
14:44.080 --> 14:46.240
Right, we have to give it a try no matter what.

338
14:46.240 --> 14:48.300
Yeah, this is Xiaoxue's last chance.

339
14:52.240 --> 14:53.170
You're all here.

340
14:56.600 --> 14:57.200
Come here.

341
14:58.040 --> 14:59.370
What are you doing here?

342
14:59.480 --> 15:00.320
I'm looking for you.

343
15:00.320 --> 15:00.840
Why are you looking for me?

344
15:00.840 --> 15:01.840
Can't you send a WeChat message?

345
15:01.840 --> 15:03.640
I asked for your contact info, but you wouldn't give it to me.

346
15:03.640 --> 15:04.520
Brother,

347
15:04.520 --> 15:05.560
please don't tell anyone.

348
15:05.560 --> 15:06.620
I'll add you later.

349
15:07.120 --> 15:08.160
Calling me brother now?

350
15:08.160 --> 15:09.040
Am I not a suitcase?

351
15:09.040 --> 15:09.560
No, Brother Xin.

352
15:09.560 --> 15:10.480
Can't I be full of myself?

353
15:10.480 --> 15:11.160
Brother Xin.

354
15:11.160 --> 15:12.420
What are you two doing?

355
15:13.880 --> 15:14.680
Nothing.

356
15:14.680 --> 15:16.160
I just came up. We haven't seen each other in a long time.

357
15:16.160 --> 15:17.440
He's excited to see me.

358
15:17.440 --> 15:19.800
Since when did you two get so close?

359
15:20.360 --> 15:22.720
People just get along, right?

360
15:22.800 --> 15:23.800
You're definitely hiding something.

361
15:23.800 --> 15:25.960
You always have this expression when you're hiding something.

362
15:25.960 --> 15:26.820
Have you eaten?

363
15:26.880 --> 15:28.160
Let's all go eat together.

364
15:28.160 --> 15:28.880
I'm not eating.

365
15:28.880 --> 15:30.240
We still have serious business to do.

366
15:30.240 --> 15:31.120
Serious business?

367
15:31.120 --> 15:31.680
What is it?

368
15:31.680 --> 15:34.340
Going to a place you definitely don't want to go.

369
15:42.800 --> 15:44.920
Alright, don't force yourself.

370
15:46.280 --> 15:47.800
Go back. We can handle it.

371
15:50.200 --> 15:52.400
More people means we'll find it faster.

372
15:53.440 --> 15:54.880
Let's clarify our target.

373
15:54.880 --> 15:56.440
The garbage bag looks like this.

374
15:56.440 --> 15:57.800
Black and small.

375
15:57.800 --> 15:58.800
Let's pair up.

376
15:58.800 --> 15:59.720
One pile per person.

377
15:59.720 --> 16:01.000
You team up with Miaomiao.

378
16:01.000 --> 16:03.040
The old class monitor teams up with Luo Zhi.

379
16:03.040 --> 16:04.100
You team up with me.

380
16:04.720 --> 16:05.560
Why?

381
16:07.560 --> 16:09.360
How did you know I wanted to team up with you?

382
16:09.360 --> 16:10.480
Leave it to Lawyer Li.

383
16:10.480 --> 16:12.010
It's much clearer this way.

384
16:12.040 --> 16:13.560
Come on, let's do it.

385
16:13.560 --> 16:14.240
Let's go.

386
16:14.240 --> 16:14.920
Go, go, go.

387
16:15.000 --> 16:16.160
Let's go.

388
16:16.160 --> 16:16.960
Let's do this.

389
16:17.400 --> 16:18.800
The tools are over there.

390
16:31.680 --> 16:34.680
Have you had any contact with that coordinator since?

391
16:35.640 --> 16:36.680
I can't reach him.

392
16:37.000 --> 16:38.120
Didn't you say we couldn't get the money back?

393
16:38.120 --> 16:38.800
Why are you asking?

394
16:38.800 --> 16:40.960
Give me all the information you have on that coordinator.

395
16:40.960 --> 16:42.620
I'll let you know if I find him.

396
16:43.200 --> 16:44.660
Pinky swear, Brother Xin.

397
16:44.960 --> 16:45.620
Brother Li.

398
16:46.120 --> 16:47.480
Please, please.

399
16:47.800 --> 16:49.920
Since when did they get so close, sis?

400
16:50.000 --> 16:50.800
I don't know.

401
16:50.960 --> 16:52.480
Maybe from enemies to friends.

402
16:52.480 --> 16:54.040
Are there any marks?

403
16:54.480 --> 16:56.280
I don't know. I haven't seen any.

404
17:11.480 --> 17:12.480
Old squad leader.

405
17:12.640 --> 17:14.160
Take a rest if you're tired.

406
17:14.160 --> 17:14.960
I'm not tired.

407
17:15.160 --> 17:17.290
I'm just a bit anxious from searching.

408
17:38.240 --> 17:39.040
No way.

409
17:40.680 --> 17:41.440
What's wrong?

410
17:41.440 --> 17:42.320
No way.

411
17:45.040 --> 17:46.120
Let me see.

412
17:46.120 --> 17:47.560
I saw some broken vases over there.

413
17:47.560 --> 17:48.480
It looked like that vase.

414
17:48.480 --> 17:50.340
And then I found it after digging.

415
17:50.560 --> 17:51.360
Really?

416
17:51.800 --> 17:53.000
It's not completely destroyed.

417
17:53.000 --> 17:55.660
Technical restoration shouldn't be a problem.

418
17:56.240 --> 17:58.160
Even TV shows wouldn't dare to film it like this.

419
17:58.160 --> 17:59.480
I'm so awesome.

420
17:59.480 --> 18:00.800
Old squad leader, you're amazing.

421
18:00.800 --> 18:01.560
Oh my God.

422
18:01.560 --> 18:02.800
I'm a great hero.

423
18:04.800 --> 18:05.800
Old squad leader.

424
18:05.960 --> 18:07.480
I'm a great hero.

425
18:07.960 --> 18:08.800
Oh my God.

426
18:08.800 --> 18:10.730
Someone is setting off fireworks.

427
18:21.800 --> 18:23.440
Today is May 20th.

428
18:23.440 --> 18:24.560
No wonder.

429
18:24.920 --> 18:26.580
We're celebrating together.

430
18:26.920 --> 18:28.120
So romantic.

431
18:28.760 --> 18:29.560
Wife.

432
18:30.000 --> 18:31.320
Look at the fireworks.

433
18:31.800 --> 18:33.160
Happy May 20th.

434
18:38.440 --> 18:40.300
Digging through trash all night,

435
18:41.320 --> 18:43.120
and suddenly seeing fireworks,

436
18:43.840 --> 18:45.360
it's like a reward.

437
18:48.440 --> 18:50.170
Looking at the world like this,

438
18:50.800 --> 18:52.320
it's quite beautiful.

439
18:53.720 --> 18:55.000
It is quite beautiful.

440
19:17.000 --> 19:17.530
Weidong.

441
19:17.800 --> 19:18.960
We are from the Heyuan Police Station.

442
19:18.960 --> 19:19.880
What's the matter?

443
19:19.880 --> 19:21.520
Weidong is suspected of rape.

444
19:21.520 --> 19:22.960
This is his detention notice.

445
19:22.960 --> 19:23.600
Please let him come with us.

446
19:23.600 --> 19:24.200
Are you mistaken?

447
19:24.200 --> 19:25.560
I'm telling you, I'm getting a lawyer.

448
19:25.560 --> 19:26.080
You can.

449
19:26.080 --> 19:27.040
But we have to take him away now.

450
19:27.040 --> 19:28.040
She was willing.

451
19:28.040 --> 19:30.040
We will investigate whether she was willing or not.

452
19:30.040 --> 19:30.760
Please cooperate with law enforcement.

453
19:30.760 --> 19:31.360
Mom. Mom. Dongdong.

454
19:31.360 --> 19:32.200
Don't be afraid.

455
19:32.200 --> 19:33.160
Dongdong, help me.

456
19:33.160 --> 19:34.280
She was willing.

457
19:37.800 --> 19:39.080
Don't worry. It's fine.

458
19:39.080 --> 19:41.400
Grandma, the evidence is conclusive this time.

459
19:41.400 --> 19:42.680
If Weidong and the others try to deny it again,

460
19:42.680 --> 19:43.800
it won't work.

461
19:43.800 --> 19:46.280
Right. The procuratorate has also intervened.

462
19:46.280 --> 19:48.600
Because the circumstances of this case are severe,

463
19:48.600 --> 19:50.280
they will definitely be heavily punished.

464
19:50.280 --> 19:52.740
They might be sentenced to five to ten years.

465
19:59.000 --> 19:59.560
This...

466
20:00.240 --> 20:01.560
Why are you here?

467
20:02.000 --> 20:02.880
You're here too.

468
20:02.880 --> 20:03.640
Auntie.

469
20:11.480 --> 20:12.120
Auntie,

470
20:12.280 --> 20:13.120
our Dongdong

471
20:13.120 --> 20:15.160
truly likes Feng Xue.

472
20:15.280 --> 20:17.880
He was indeed a bit impulsive that day.

473
20:18.080 --> 20:19.760
Once we become family,

474
20:19.800 --> 20:21.440
we can put this behind us.

475
20:21.840 --> 20:22.880
Xiaoxue's grandmother,

476
20:22.880 --> 20:24.340
look, this time we've even

477
20:24.880 --> 20:26.760
bought the marital home.

478
20:27.480 --> 20:29.960
Our Xiaoxue will absolutely not marry into your family.

479
20:29.960 --> 20:31.280
No, enough. Stop talking.

480
20:31.280 --> 20:33.280
You want Xiaoxue to change her statement?

481
20:33.280 --> 20:34.800
Save your breath.

482
20:34.800 --> 20:35.880
Don't embarrass yourselves.

483
20:35.880 --> 20:38.680
Weidong's crime is an undeniable fact now.

484
20:38.680 --> 20:40.800
I beg you to stop making things difficult for Feng Xue.

485
20:40.800 --> 20:41.440
No, you...

486
20:42.480 --> 20:44.800
Auntie, think about it.

487
20:44.920 --> 20:47.120
Our Feng Xue is deaf and mute.

488
20:47.120 --> 20:49.080
My son is a master's student,

489
20:49.080 --> 20:51.320
a key talent cultivated by his workplace.

490
20:51.320 --> 20:53.240
You're really interesting parents.

491
20:53.240 --> 20:54.960
Instead of educating your child properly after such an incident,

492
20:54.960 --> 20:56.000
you come here to say disgusting things.

493
20:56.000 --> 20:57.130
What kind of talent?

494
20:57.320 --> 20:58.850
A talent worse than a beast.

495
20:58.920 --> 20:59.960
Hey, what are you saying?

496
20:59.960 --> 21:01.480
What are you doing? Are you going to hit someone?

497
21:01.480 --> 21:04.120
The surveillance in this room can't be tampered with.

498
21:04.120 --> 21:04.920
Go, go, go.

499
21:04.920 --> 21:05.920
Auntie, let's go.

500
21:05.920 --> 21:06.800
Your aunt isn't here.

501
21:06.800 --> 21:08.800
How about we exchange contact info?

502
21:09.440 --> 21:11.840
Xiaoxue is asking what's going on outside.

503
21:14.920 --> 21:15.480
Let's go.

504
21:17.040 --> 21:19.170
Weidong's parents came to apologize.

505
21:19.320 --> 21:21.250
They said they regret it very much.

506
21:24.360 --> 21:26.400
Their son committed a crime.

507
21:26.400 --> 21:29.160
They feel they didn't raise him well

508
21:29.160 --> 21:31.960
and are reflecting deeply.

509
21:36.640 --> 21:38.400
It's okay. That's all in the past.

510
21:38.400 --> 21:39.330
Don't be afraid.

511
21:50.200 --> 21:51.560
This is our tea art room.

512
21:53.280 --> 21:55.320
And over here is our art classroom.

513
22:03.320 --> 22:05.320
This is our fabric art studio.

514
22:10.960 --> 22:12.440
And this is our bakery.

515
22:12.440 --> 22:13.120
Xiaoxue.

516
22:13.240 --> 22:16.120
Not only does this school have academic classes every day,

517
22:16.120 --> 22:17.160
but after graduation,

518
22:17.160 --> 22:18.640
they also directly arrange for the students

519
22:18.640 --> 22:20.440
to work in the corresponding bakeries.

520
22:20.440 --> 22:22.300
I can't explain it well. You do it.

521
22:29.280 --> 22:30.680
The bread smells so good.

522
22:30.840 --> 22:32.840
Xiaoxue, do you like bread?

523
22:43.280 --> 22:44.480
Thank you.

524
22:44.880 --> 22:46.640
You're welcome.

525
22:48.040 --> 22:50.560
If you have any difficulties in the future,

526
22:50.560 --> 22:52.920
feel free to come to us.

527
22:53.320 --> 22:54.600
We believe

528
22:54.600 --> 22:57.240
you are the best baker.

529
23:07.760 --> 23:09.360
This leak incident in Wangang

530
23:09.360 --> 23:10.800
is extremely serious in nature.

531
23:10.800 --> 23:12.000
In the coming period,

532
23:12.000 --> 23:13.240
colleagues from the compliance department

533
23:13.240 --> 23:15.400
will investigate both of your teams.

534
23:15.520 --> 23:17.560
I expect your 100% cooperation.

535
23:17.880 --> 23:19.560
At 4:00 p.m. last Thursday,

536
23:19.680 --> 23:22.120
after receiving the information from Wangang,

537
23:22.120 --> 23:22.880
what did you do?

538
23:22.880 --> 23:24.680
I quickly flipped through the materials

539
23:24.680 --> 23:25.640
and with Lanya,

540
23:25.640 --> 23:27.040
also known as Lawyer Guo Jin,

541
23:27.040 --> 23:28.560
we had a brief discussion.

542
23:28.560 --> 23:30.600
My team strictly follows confidentiality rules.

543
23:30.600 --> 23:31.720
But my team wasn't the only one

544
23:31.720 --> 23:33.120
that saw the materials.

545
23:34.400 --> 23:37.240
But I repeatedly emphasized confidentiality discipline.

546
23:37.240 --> 23:40.200
Did you contact Director Wan's assistant that Thursday?

547
23:40.200 --> 23:41.930
It was just work coordination.

548
23:42.040 --> 23:44.120
No project details were mentioned.

549
23:44.120 --> 23:45.760
I was in court at the Intermediate Court.

550
23:45.760 --> 23:47.080
You can check the trial records.

551
23:47.080 --> 23:48.160
I was out of the office

552
23:48.160 --> 23:49.480
and met a client at a cafe.

553
23:49.480 --> 23:51.480
I was organizing old cases at the firm.

554
23:51.480 --> 23:53.000
Ding Chao can testify for me.

555
23:53.000 --> 23:54.520
Did you disclose to anyone outside

556
23:54.520 --> 23:56.440
any project information about Wangang?

557
23:56.440 --> 23:57.760
I am an intern lawyer.

558
23:57.760 --> 23:58.920
Lawyer Li didn't distribute

559
23:58.920 --> 24:00.240
any relevant content of this project to me.

560
24:00.240 --> 24:01.560
I did assist in copying

561
24:01.560 --> 24:03.020
some relevant materials.

562
24:03.200 --> 24:04.660
But those were all public.

563
24:04.800 --> 24:05.440
Mr. Li,

564
24:05.560 --> 24:06.840
based on the forum poster's

565
24:06.840 --> 24:07.680
IP address,

566
24:07.920 --> 24:08.800
I located

567
24:08.800 --> 24:10.120
an internet cafe next to the law firm.

568
24:10.120 --> 24:11.920
Here is the surveillance video.

569
24:14.080 --> 24:15.360
He's all bundled up.

570
24:15.360 --> 24:16.120
Is this the guy?

571
24:16.120 --> 24:16.800
That's him.

572
24:16.800 --> 24:18.240
There are other angles in the video.

573
24:18.240 --> 24:18.920
Look.

574
24:19.000 --> 24:20.640
His computer screen shows

575
24:20.640 --> 24:23.700
the website where the insider information was posted.

576
24:24.120 --> 24:26.760
Look, this person is wearing a ring on his left ring finger.

577
24:26.760 --> 24:27.640
He's married.

578
24:29.400 --> 24:30.760
His phone lit up.

579
24:32.080 --> 24:35.280
I think I've seen this phone wallpaper somewhere before.

580
24:39.000 --> 24:40.400
That Lawyer Han behind me

581
24:40.680 --> 24:42.610
is really from Lawyer Shen's team.

582
24:44.920 --> 24:45.800
This matter

583
24:46.840 --> 24:48.900
is indeed Honghu's responsibility.

584
24:50.040 --> 24:51.680
The lawyer involved, Han Song,

585
24:51.680 --> 24:52.920
has already been fired by us.

586
24:52.920 --> 24:55.400
The judicial authorities will also revoke his law license.

587
24:55.400 --> 24:57.000
The police will also open an investigation

588
24:57.000 --> 24:59.080
and hold him criminally responsible.

589
24:59.080 --> 24:59.810
In addition,

590
25:00.840 --> 25:02.000
our law firm

591
25:02.880 --> 25:05.840
is willing to waive half of next year's consulting fee

592
25:05.840 --> 25:06.760
as an apology.

593
25:06.840 --> 25:08.960
Director, Mr. Wan,

594
25:09.360 --> 25:11.490
it is indeed my poor judgment in hiring

595
25:11.760 --> 25:13.290
and failure in leadership.

596
25:13.440 --> 25:16.000
I am willing to take full responsibility.

597
25:16.160 --> 25:17.020
Attorney Shen.

598
25:17.240 --> 25:18.240
From now on,

599
25:18.640 --> 25:21.760
you will withdraw from all matters related to Wangang

600
25:21.760 --> 25:23.400
and hand them over to Lawyer Li's team.

601
25:23.400 --> 25:24.360
Director,

602
25:24.640 --> 25:27.720
there's no need for collective punishment over such a small matter.

603
25:27.720 --> 25:29.200
If we're talking about collective punishment,

604
25:29.200 --> 25:32.240
then the entire Honghu should also be punished,

605
25:32.360 --> 25:33.080
right?

606
25:33.400 --> 25:34.800
This matter

607
25:34.880 --> 25:35.680
is not exactly small,

608
25:35.680 --> 25:37.000
but not too big either.

609
25:38.280 --> 25:40.960
I think it's better to turn big problems into small ones

610
25:40.960 --> 25:43.040
and small ones into nothing. Let it go.

611
25:43.040 --> 25:45.280
Mr. Wan, you are magnanimous.

612
25:45.840 --> 25:48.480
But we have to take it seriously.

613
25:49.440 --> 25:51.200
Why so serious?

614
25:51.520 --> 25:53.600
We are all good friends.

615
25:54.680 --> 25:55.440
Friends.

616
25:55.720 --> 25:58.320
Friends should help each other.

617
25:59.320 --> 26:02.200
It's good for everyone.

618
26:03.720 --> 26:04.240
Right?

619
26:04.800 --> 26:05.600
Right, right.

620
26:09.400 --> 26:10.040
Lawyer Li.

621
26:12.280 --> 26:13.280
What do you think?

622
26:16.520 --> 26:18.450
Mr. Wan, regarding your decision,

623
26:18.880 --> 26:21.080
do I still need to inform President Wan?

624
26:26.880 --> 26:28.080
For such a small matter,

625
26:28.080 --> 26:31.210
there's no need for President Wan to decide personally.

626
26:31.760 --> 26:32.440
What?

627
26:32.880 --> 26:34.960
Do you think my words carry no weight?

628
26:38.680 --> 26:39.320
Well,

629
26:39.880 --> 26:41.000
for this matter,

630
26:41.120 --> 26:43.520
let's just follow Mr. Wan's instructions.

631
26:43.960 --> 26:45.240
But Lawyer Shen,

632
26:45.680 --> 26:46.960
keep your team in check.

633
26:46.960 --> 26:47.760
Of course.

634
26:48.360 --> 26:49.560
Thank you, Director,

635
26:49.560 --> 26:50.820
and thank you, Mr. Wan.

636
26:51.000 --> 26:53.440
I definitely won't betray your trust.

637
26:54.680 --> 26:55.280
Fighting!

638
26:57.600 --> 26:58.520
Handsome.

639
27:00.280 --> 27:01.120
Mr. Wan,

640
27:01.760 --> 27:03.200
say hello to President Wan for me.

641
27:03.200 --> 27:03.920
Okay.

642
27:28.240 --> 27:29.570
What are you hiding for?

643
27:30.680 --> 27:31.940
Think you can run away?

644
27:32.720 --> 27:34.280
You really know how to pick a spot.

645
27:34.280 --> 27:35.740
Hiding in a dump like this.

646
27:35.840 --> 27:36.920
I'm telling you,

647
27:36.960 --> 27:38.280
you don't need to follow.

648
27:38.280 --> 27:38.920
Mom.

649
27:39.680 --> 27:41.280
My friend wants to talk to me.

650
27:41.520 --> 27:43.680
Go outside and get some sun first.

651
27:44.320 --> 27:45.250
Here, slow down.

652
27:57.000 --> 27:58.260
I have 200,000 tied up.

653
27:59.400 --> 28:00.800
If I can't make up this shortfall,

654
28:00.800 --> 28:02.930
the bank will take away our bathhouse.

655
28:03.280 --> 28:04.210
What should I do?

656
28:18.880 --> 28:20.210
Mom, what are you doing?

657
28:20.360 --> 28:21.800
Didn't the doctor tell you to rest?

658
28:21.800 --> 28:23.240
It's fine. It's nothing.

659
28:23.240 --> 28:23.960
Give it to me.

660
28:23.960 --> 28:24.720
Okay.

661
28:24.720 --> 28:25.240
I'll do it.

662
28:25.240 --> 28:27.040
Look at how messy your room is.

663
28:27.040 --> 28:28.480
You don't even tidy it up.

664
28:35.320 --> 28:36.000
Huzi,

665
28:36.440 --> 28:38.000
let's buy a house this year.

666
28:40.760 --> 28:41.800
Why buy a house?

667
28:43.320 --> 28:44.200
You're a grown man now.

668
28:44.200 --> 28:45.240
You can't always

669
28:45.240 --> 28:46.880
live in this storage room.

670
28:46.880 --> 28:48.720
You'll have to get a wife sooner or later.

671
28:48.720 --> 28:50.160
I've done the math.

672
28:50.160 --> 28:52.000
The money I have on hand now

673
28:53.040 --> 28:53.800
is almost

674
28:53.800 --> 28:56.520
enough for a down payment on a small two-bedroom apartment.

675
28:56.520 --> 28:58.120
We can't be picky about the location.

676
28:58.120 --> 28:59.760
As long as transit is convenient.

677
28:59.760 --> 29:01.040
As for the monthly mortgage,

678
29:01.040 --> 29:02.520
you don't have to worry too much.

679
29:02.520 --> 29:04.320
Our small bathhouse's

680
29:04.360 --> 29:05.520
monthly income

681
29:06.600 --> 29:07.520
is enough to cover it.

682
29:07.520 --> 29:08.520
I'm not buying.

683
29:08.720 --> 29:09.560
Look,

684
29:09.560 --> 29:10.520
who buys a house now?

685
29:10.520 --> 29:12.080
Look at how much housing prices have fallen.

686
29:12.080 --> 29:13.480
What are you talking about?

687
29:13.480 --> 29:14.600
I'm not going to be a bagholder.

688
29:14.600 --> 29:16.280
You're over 1.8 meters tall.

689
29:16.280 --> 29:18.440
You can't even stretch your legs out on this bed.

690
29:18.440 --> 29:19.960
Then I just won't stretch them.

691
29:19.960 --> 29:21.520
I like to sleep curled up.

692
29:21.520 --> 29:22.560
Don't worry about it.

693
29:22.560 --> 29:23.640
Just go back. I'm tired.

694
29:23.640 --> 29:23.880
Go on.

695
29:23.880 --> 29:27.200
Why do you get sleepy whenever I talk about serious matters?

696
29:27.200 --> 29:27.800
I'm too sleepy.

697
29:27.800 --> 29:28.840
Is your brain lacking oxygen?

698
29:28.840 --> 29:30.840
Go, go, go. Follow the doctor's advice.

699
29:30.840 --> 29:32.770
Think carefully about what I said.

700
29:32.800 --> 29:33.560
I got it.

701
29:33.960 --> 29:34.890
Watch your back.

702
29:50.080 --> 29:51.740
I have 200,000 tied up in this.

703
29:52.280 --> 29:53.640
What are you going to do about it?

704
29:53.640 --> 29:54.900
I'm worse off than you.

705
29:56.200 --> 29:57.760
I sold my house and car,

706
29:58.200 --> 30:00.000
and took out a loan for a million.

707
30:00.600 --> 30:02.200
I have nothing left now.

708
30:02.600 --> 30:04.080
I'm completely bankrupt.

709
30:04.440 --> 30:06.200
Don't pull that shameless act on me.

710
30:06.200 --> 30:07.520
Give me a solution.

711
30:10.000 --> 30:11.200
Do whatever you want.

712
30:12.000 --> 30:13.280
Call the police if you want.

713
30:13.280 --> 30:15.610
If you see anything valuable in this room,

714
30:15.800 --> 30:16.840
just take it.

715
30:17.800 --> 30:19.130
I wanted to get rich too.

716
30:19.240 --> 30:20.840
I wanted to prove myself too.

717
30:21.560 --> 30:23.020
But who would have thought

718
30:24.040 --> 30:25.640
that in my forties,

719
30:27.160 --> 30:31.680
I'd still be making my old mother worry about me?

720
31:14.000 --> 31:14.960
Need to file a lawsuit, friend?

721
31:14.960 --> 31:16.400
We are very professional.

722
31:16.400 --> 31:17.640
Our law firm is very professional.

723
31:17.640 --> 31:18.520
From a law firm.

724
31:18.800 --> 31:19.840
You can't hand out flyers here.

725
31:19.840 --> 31:20.840
This way, please.

726
31:20.840 --> 31:22.040
No, it's not a flyer.

727
31:22.040 --> 31:23.280
Just making friends.

728
31:23.400 --> 31:24.840
Any difficulties lately?

729
31:24.840 --> 31:26.120
Are you looking for a law firm?

730
31:26.120 --> 31:27.250
Come check out ours.

731
31:27.640 --> 31:29.040
Are you filing a lawsuit?

732
31:31.760 --> 31:32.760
Filing a lawsuit, bro?

733
31:32.760 --> 31:33.600
Are you looking for a lawyer?

734
31:33.600 --> 31:34.080
No, no, no.

735
31:34.080 --> 31:34.400
No, no, no.

736
31:34.400 --> 31:35.400
We specialize in lawsuits.

737
31:35.400 --> 31:36.130
Really, bro.

738
31:36.200 --> 31:37.440
Are they not good enough?

739
31:37.440 --> 31:38.400
We also run a law firm.

740
31:38.400 --> 31:39.920
Very professional and reasonably priced.

741
31:39.920 --> 31:41.280
You can trust our firm.

742
31:41.280 --> 31:42.120
Our firm is the most... Right.

743
31:42.120 --> 31:43.760
Our firm is the most professional on this street.

744
31:43.760 --> 31:44.280
Which one?

745
31:44.280 --> 31:45.840
Here, Xiaolongnv Law Firm.

746
31:50.600 --> 31:51.200
A big case.

747
31:51.280 --> 31:52.840
This family is very powerful.

748
31:52.840 --> 31:53.360
Money is not an issue.

749
31:53.360 --> 31:54.290
What kind of job?

750
31:56.640 --> 31:57.440
Drug trafficking.

751
31:57.440 --> 31:58.040
What?

752
31:58.280 --> 31:59.080
Drug trafficking.

753
31:59.080 --> 32:00.120
Drug trafficking?

754
32:00.120 --> 32:01.080
I can't take it.

755
32:01.160 --> 32:02.440
Don't be so quick to reject it.

756
32:02.440 --> 32:03.960
Listen to their terms first.

757
32:03.960 --> 32:05.120
It doesn't matter which lawyer takes it.

758
32:05.120 --> 32:07.360
For every year reduced from the sentence, the reward is 100,000.

759
32:07.360 --> 32:09.120
If it's a suspended sentence, it's one million.

760
32:09.120 --> 32:10.400
I wouldn't take it for ten billion.

761
32:10.400 --> 32:12.800
Not taking drug cases is my bottom line and principle.

762
32:12.800 --> 32:14.800
Why do you have so many bottom lines?

763
32:14.800 --> 32:15.800
If you keep doing this.

764
32:15.800 --> 32:17.040
How many years can this law firm survive?

765
32:17.040 --> 32:18.560
You have a threshold for taking cases.

766
32:18.560 --> 32:19.760
You give discounts on lawsuits.

767
32:19.760 --> 32:21.320
And sometimes you even pay out of your own pocket.

768
32:21.320 --> 32:23.440
How are you going to expand the business like this?

769
32:23.440 --> 32:25.440
Can't I just expand it slowly?

770
32:25.440 --> 32:26.360
Dong Beihu, you...

771
32:26.360 --> 32:27.120
Dong Beihu.

772
32:28.360 --> 32:29.800
What's wrong, directors?

773
32:29.800 --> 32:31.480
What's the deal with your law firm?

774
32:31.480 --> 32:31.920
What's wrong?

775
32:31.920 --> 32:32.800
This Dong Beihu.

776
32:32.800 --> 32:33.800
Just now downstairs.

777
32:33.800 --> 32:34.960
On the entire lawyer street.

778
32:34.960 --> 32:36.800
He was snatching cases and clients like crazy.

779
32:36.800 --> 32:39.200
I just got a client and he stole them.

780
32:39.280 --> 32:40.640
What are you doing? Malicious competition?

781
32:40.640 --> 32:42.300
Exactly. How could he do this?

782
32:42.320 --> 32:43.640
Dong Beihu is from your firm.

783
32:43.640 --> 32:44.840
Are you going to do something about it?

784
32:44.840 --> 32:46.000
Of course I will.

785
32:46.520 --> 32:47.160
Well,

786
32:47.920 --> 32:50.250
hurry up and apologize sincerely. Quick.

787
32:52.360 --> 32:54.120
Are your old habits acting up again?

788
32:54.120 --> 32:55.450
Being greedy for money?

789
32:55.840 --> 32:57.040
Apologize right now.

790
33:07.760 --> 33:09.520
What's with that attitude? What do you mean?

791
33:09.520 --> 33:10.580
Stubborn as a mule.

792
33:10.720 --> 33:12.180
I apologize on his behalf.

793
33:50.680 --> 33:51.740
What are you doing?

794
33:52.200 --> 33:53.120
What are you doing?

795
33:53.120 --> 33:54.880
A birthday gift. Here.

796
33:55.480 --> 33:57.280
You still remember my birthday?

797
33:58.680 --> 33:59.740
Are you kidding me?

798
34:05.520 --> 34:06.650
What does this mean?

799
34:06.720 --> 34:08.120
There's 500,000 on the card.

800
34:08.120 --> 34:09.600
Pay off your loan first.

801
34:10.320 --> 34:11.920
How did you know I have a loan?

802
34:15.600 --> 34:16.600
Look, is this you?

803
34:24.159 --> 34:26.000
Where did you find this list?

804
34:26.000 --> 34:27.880
How did this get leaked?

805
34:30.840 --> 34:33.239
Didn't I tell you my dad came looking for me?

806
34:33.320 --> 34:35.199
His surname is Wan. Wan Jiliang.

807
34:35.480 --> 34:36.239
Wan Jiliang?

808
34:37.880 --> 34:39.940
Why does this name sound so familiar?

809
34:40.000 --> 34:42.530
The boss of Wangang is also named Wan Jiliang.

810
34:43.840 --> 34:45.170
Wan Jiliang is your dad?

811
34:47.000 --> 34:50.040
Then, Dali, you're set for life!

812
34:51.040 --> 34:51.760
Then, from now on,

813
34:51.760 --> 34:52.760
will you have to change your surname to Wan?

814
34:52.760 --> 34:54.000
Will you be called Wan Zhuoli?

815
34:54.000 --> 34:55.239
That's for the public.

816
34:55.239 --> 34:57.760
Between us, you can still call me Dali.

817
34:58.040 --> 34:59.240
I'm still your Dali.

818
35:00.320 --> 35:01.120
Well, Dali,

819
35:01.520 --> 35:02.520
this is too much.

820
35:02.520 --> 35:03.400
I can't accept this.

821
35:03.400 --> 35:05.840
When will I ever be able to pay back 500,000?

822
35:06.480 --> 35:08.040
Who asked you to pay it back?

823
35:08.040 --> 35:09.080
Well, your loss

824
35:09.080 --> 35:11.140
actually has something to do with me.

825
35:11.480 --> 35:13.210
I have to take responsibility.

826
35:14.320 --> 35:15.760
This is too much.

827
35:15.760 --> 35:17.880
Just consider it an advance on your salary.

828
35:17.880 --> 35:18.800
It's only a year's worth.

829
35:18.800 --> 35:20.040
Are you kidding me?

830
35:20.040 --> 35:21.880
Who makes 500,000 a year?

831
35:22.000 --> 35:22.840
No, Huzi.

832
35:23.520 --> 35:25.560
I really want you to come and help me.

833
35:26.680 --> 35:28.760
Haven't you always wanted to get rich?

834
35:28.760 --> 35:31.220
This is such a great opportunity for you now.

835
35:31.560 --> 35:33.440
Even if you don't think about yourself,

836
35:33.440 --> 35:35.440
you should think about Sister Pang.

837
35:35.840 --> 35:37.000
How old is she?

838
35:37.400 --> 35:40.800
I want to be good to my mom now, but I don't even have the chance.

839
35:49.640 --> 35:53.400
I really don't want you to have this regret too.

840
35:56.240 --> 35:56.760
Come on.

841
36:07.600 --> 36:11.600
Happy birthday!

842
36:14.240 --> 36:15.440
Everyone's here.

843
36:15.440 --> 36:17.640
My uncle is stunned.

844
36:17.880 --> 36:20.410
Come and take the seat of honor, birthday boy.

845
36:22.240 --> 36:23.000
Brother Hu.

846
36:23.000 --> 36:23.600
Come on.

847
36:23.600 --> 36:25.480
This is a gift we picked out for you together,

848
36:25.480 --> 36:26.360
little tiger.

849
36:27.040 --> 36:28.960
Today is my uncle's birthday.

850
36:28.960 --> 36:30.880
Can I be bold and propose a toast first?

851
36:30.880 --> 36:31.520
Go ahead.

852
36:31.920 --> 36:34.520
I wish my uncle a roaring success

853
36:35.040 --> 36:36.360
and a great new journey.

854
36:36.360 --> 36:37.520
Like a tiger with wings.

855
36:37.520 --> 36:38.480
Full of vigor and vitality.

856
36:38.480 --> 36:40.200
I'll propose a serious toast.

857
36:40.200 --> 36:42.960
Today, my words were a bit harsh.

858
36:43.720 --> 36:44.980
Don't take it to heart.

859
36:45.040 --> 36:46.520
Brother Hu is broad-minded.

860
36:46.520 --> 36:47.880
You won't hold it against me.

861
36:47.880 --> 36:48.560
As for me,

862
36:48.560 --> 36:50.920
I've also done some deep self-reflection.

863
36:50.920 --> 36:52.720
Indeed, sometimes when I take on cases,

864
36:52.720 --> 36:54.800
I'm just too impulsive.

865
36:55.120 --> 36:56.320
I don't consider everyone's feelings,

866
36:56.320 --> 36:57.680
especially yours.

867
36:58.000 --> 36:58.600
I'm sorry.

868
36:59.240 --> 37:00.400
From now on,

869
37:00.640 --> 37:01.520
I think

870
37:01.520 --> 37:03.250
we should take on more big cases

871
37:03.560 --> 37:05.800
to boost our law firm's profits.

872
37:06.000 --> 37:06.400
Right?

873
37:06.400 --> 37:07.600
Good.

874
37:08.000 --> 37:08.800
I'll drink up.

875
37:09.600 --> 37:10.600
I'll drink up too.

876
37:11.440 --> 37:12.920
Let's hurry up to the next part.

877
37:12.920 --> 37:13.680
Next part.

878
37:13.680 --> 37:15.480
Light the candles for Brother Hu.

879
37:15.480 --> 37:15.810
Okay.

880
37:16.120 --> 37:17.440
Make a wish.

881
37:18.000 --> 37:19.680
You look handsome in this hat.

882
37:22.960 --> 37:23.400
Light the candles.

883
37:23.400 --> 37:24.200
Wait a minute.

884
37:25.440 --> 37:27.100
Since everyone is here today,

885
37:29.160 --> 37:30.620
I'd like to say a few words.

886
37:32.880 --> 37:37.040
Thank you all for taking care of me for over a year.

887
37:38.800 --> 37:40.920
Meeting you all

888
37:42.680 --> 37:44.720
is the luckiest thing in my life.

889
37:58.040 --> 37:59.040
Old Squad Leader,

890
38:00.040 --> 38:04.000
there aren't many people I truly admire,

891
38:05.000 --> 38:06.930
but you are definitely one of them.

892
38:07.720 --> 38:08.400
Miaomiao,

893
38:08.960 --> 38:11.760
even though you always argue with me,

894
38:14.120 --> 38:15.200
in my heart,

895
38:16.360 --> 38:17.820
you are like my own sister.

896
38:18.560 --> 38:19.080
Nephew,

897
38:19.480 --> 38:21.920
we are family, so there's no need for formalities.

898
38:21.920 --> 38:23.480
You'll definitely pass the bar exam.

899
38:23.480 --> 38:24.280
Of course.

900
38:27.480 --> 38:28.280
Drink slowly.

901
38:28.280 --> 38:29.320
You lack alcohol dehydrogenase.

902
38:29.320 --> 38:30.240
If you pass out later,

903
38:30.240 --> 38:31.700
who's going to help you up?

904
38:33.400 --> 38:34.130
Sister Long,

905
38:34.160 --> 38:36.760
I have to toast you personally with this glass.

906
38:37.520 --> 38:38.720
In my heart,

907
38:39.480 --> 38:42.200
on this street of lawyers,

908
38:43.520 --> 38:46.000
no, in all of Leyang City,

909
38:48.520 --> 38:49.850
you are the best lawyer.

910
38:50.400 --> 38:52.360
You have passion,

911
38:53.160 --> 38:54.040
ideals,

912
38:54.600 --> 38:55.600
and persistence.

913
38:56.480 --> 38:59.680
You have many things that I don't have.

914
39:00.680 --> 39:01.640
I believe

915
39:02.760 --> 39:04.800
under your leadership,

916
39:06.040 --> 39:08.700
our law firm will definitely be RISING JUSTICE.

917
39:09.720 --> 39:11.640
You're making me emotional.

918
39:12.560 --> 39:13.160
Don't.

919
39:18.480 --> 39:19.160
I'm sorry.

920
39:22.600 --> 39:23.530
I want to resign.

921
39:36.120 --> 39:37.960
Uncle, making this joke now

922
39:37.960 --> 39:38.720
isn't funny.

923
39:38.720 --> 39:39.560
What a terrible joke.

924
39:39.560 --> 39:40.840
Brother Hu, try another one.

925
39:40.840 --> 39:41.700
I'm not joking.

926
39:43.440 --> 39:44.840
I have a childhood friend

927
39:45.000 --> 39:46.640
who went abroad when we were young.

928
39:46.640 --> 39:48.440
He came back a couple of days ago.

929
39:48.520 --> 39:49.960
He opened a bathhouse

930
39:50.160 --> 39:51.490
and asked me to help out.

931
39:52.400 --> 39:53.280
It makes sense.

932
39:53.280 --> 39:55.560
The bathhouse is my old profession,

933
39:55.560 --> 39:56.280
right?

934
39:59.160 --> 40:00.000
Beihu,

935
40:00.160 --> 40:01.920
such a major decision,

936
40:02.440 --> 40:03.960
won't you reconsider?

937
40:05.080 --> 40:06.360
Look at me,

938
40:08.160 --> 40:09.420
I'm not young anymore.

939
40:10.400 --> 40:13.360
Before, going out to find clients

940
40:15.360 --> 40:16.960
was something I could make do with.

941
40:16.960 --> 40:17.760
But,

942
40:20.240 --> 40:22.770
I'm just not cut out for the legal profession.

943
40:23.560 --> 40:25.400
I bought so many books on criminal law,

944
40:25.400 --> 40:27.800
but I've only read about ten pages in total.

945
40:29.440 --> 40:30.560
And now,

946
40:30.720 --> 40:32.580
our law firm is on the right track,

947
40:33.240 --> 40:34.680
and we don't lack cases.

948
40:35.080 --> 40:36.240
What I can do

949
40:37.120 --> 40:38.520
is getting less and less.

950
40:48.000 --> 40:49.460
Have you made up your mind?

951
40:50.480 --> 40:52.080
You're definitely leaving?

952
40:57.280 --> 40:58.560
Here it comes.

953
40:58.600 --> 41:01.200
Hot longevity noodles are here.

954
41:01.720 --> 41:02.280
It's okay.

955
41:02.280 --> 41:03.560
You just sit.

956
41:03.800 --> 41:05.240
Thanks to you guys.

957
41:05.240 --> 41:07.880
You've helped Hu a lot recently.

958
41:08.800 --> 41:09.600
What's wrong?

959
41:11.120 --> 41:11.720
Nothing.

960
41:12.360 --> 41:14.880
Sister Pang, it's his birthday.

961
41:14.880 --> 41:15.920
We were just chatting,

962
41:15.920 --> 41:17.120
and he got emotional.

963
41:18.360 --> 41:19.080
Brother Hu,

964
41:20.120 --> 41:21.880
today is your big day.

965
41:22.560 --> 41:25.280
On behalf of our law firm, I wish you

966
41:26.960 --> 41:28.200
wealth,

967
41:29.160 --> 41:30.400
success,

968
41:30.960 --> 41:32.040
good health,

969
41:33.520 --> 41:34.720
and happiness.

970
41:39.360 --> 41:40.080
Nephew,

971
41:41.200 --> 41:43.060
light the candles and make a wish.

972
41:55.440 --> 41:56.160
I hope...

973
41:58.200 --> 42:00.080
I hope everyone is doing well.

974
42:05.400 --> 42:06.400
It won't blow out.

975
42:08.360 --> 42:09.160
I...

976
42:12.120 --> 42:13.050
I drank too fast.

977
42:15.920 --> 42:17.760
It went straight to my head.

978
42:18.200 --> 42:19.000
I can't take it.

979
42:19.000 --> 42:22.680
I'm going back to lie down for a while.

980
42:23.240 --> 42:24.640
Otherwise, I'll embarrass myself.

981
42:24.640 --> 42:24.960
Well...

982
42:24.960 --> 42:26.280
You guys eat.

983
42:30.760 --> 42:31.600
This kid.

984
42:32.040 --> 42:33.170
I'll go check on him.

985
42:34.280 --> 42:35.280
You go ahead and eat.
